==Notes==
* The caster must make a successful melee [[touch attack]] on the target.
** The touch attack occurs after the spell resistance check, which might consume [[spell mantle]]s needlessly.
* The save is versus death, but neither descriptor provides immunity to this spell as a whole. Immunity to [[death magic]] applies if the save is failed, while immunity to negative energy damage applies if the save succeeds. Perhaps unintentionally, death-immune targets are better off failing the save.
* Due to a .2da bug, ''death ward'' is not an additional [[counterspell]] of this spell.

